
Also add this to `.gitignore` so Git enforces the rule independently of Codex:

```gitignore
# Local environment and secrets
.env
.env.*
*.env
.flaskenv
.envrc
secrets.py
secrets.toml
.streamlit/secrets.toml

# Keep templates
!.env.example
!.env.sample
!.env.template

# Python virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/